<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Some Magma copper assets non-core-BHP.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Some Magma copper assets non-core-BHP.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1997-06-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Broken Hill Pty Co Ltd said on Friday that some of its recently-acquired North American copper operations did not form part of the group's key core businesses.</p>
</text>
